  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{世|よ} (world, society) + {渡|わた}り (crossing, getting across) - crossing through the world/society.\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used with:\n- {上手|じょうず} - good at social navigation\n- {下手|へた} - bad at social navigation\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {世渡|よわた}りが{上手|じょうず} - good at getting by\n- {世渡|よわた}りが{下手|へた} - not good at social navigation\n- {世渡|よわた}り{上手|じょうず} - socially savvy person\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {処世術|しょせいじゅつ} - wisdom for getting through life\n- {根回|ねまわ}し - behind-the-scenes preparation",
